{
  "purpose": "Synthetic, labelled secret-scan corpus across languages and template styles. A line is an array of parts joined at test time, so this repository never holds a token-shaped string. Every value is fake. `expect` lists each line a finding must be on, with its class and whether it blocks Level 2 under rubric 2026-12-beta; a finding on any other line, or a blocking one that isn't labelled blocking, fails tests/secrets.test.ts.",
